ap`. \r\n\r\nI did try to replace other `HashMap`s, but other than these they all resulted in worse FPS.\r\n\r\n> A previous version of this PR also modified `static_variables_indices`, but for the benchmark below it seems to bottleneck the case, so I kept it only on `member_indices`.\r\n\r\nAll I did was drop-in replace the hash map type, so this PR should remain harmless as it doesn't use `getptr` or `erase`.\r\n\r\nTest project: [bunnymark_custom.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30023157/bunnymark_custom.tar.gz), with 10000 bunnies.\r\n\r\n| Run | `master` | PR |\r\n|-|-|-|\r\n| 1 | 163.53 | 178.87 |\r\n| 2 | 162.93 | 178.40 |\r\n| 3 | 162.60 | 180.20 |","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-26T00:27:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T14:28:05Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T14:27:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6bb5165632aea14474c628f889af4ad97538178f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url"